This file is designed as an explanation on how files should be organized so that the FNR Guide Parser can proper contextualize the files for their respective formable.

Country-Specific formables should be labeled as fnr_TAG_privileges 
(Example: fnr_RHLND_privileges, would directly add privileges for RHLND.)

Country-Grouped formables should be labeled as fnr_GROUPED_slavs_privileges
(Example: fnr_GROUPED_slavs_privileges, would directly add privileges for various slavic nations such as Great Moravia, as well as Hungary and Slovenia.)